# Essence Channeler: "Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature", and its first ability "cares whether you've
# lost life this turn, not how your life total has changed" (ruling 2024-07-26). Bot1's Tendrils of Agony (storm count zero:
# the turn's first spell) drains Bot2 for 2: Bot1 gains 2, so the Channeler gets a counter (3/2), but gaining is not losing, so
# it has no flying or vigilance yet. Then Bot1's Thoughtseize makes Bot1 lose 2 life: Bot1 is back at 20, no lower than the turn
# began, and the Channeler has flying and vigilance all the same. Bot2's Lightning Bolt is the card Thoughtseize takes
# (on top of the Island Bot2 discarded to hand size in its turn).

